00pt left blank 458.0000pt left blank 503.8000pt left blank 549.6000pt left blank 595.4000pt left blank 641.2000pt left blank 687.0000pt left blank 732.8000pt ;=20text-align:left;=20font-family:宋体;=20font-size:12.0000pt;=20}=20=20span.msoIns{=20mso-style-type:export-only;=20mso-style-name:"";=20text-decoration:underline;=20text-underline:single;=20color:blue;=20}=20=20span.msoDel{=20mso-style-type:export-only;=20mso-style-name:"";=20text-decoration:line-through;=20color:red;=20}=20=20table.MsoNormalTable{=20mso-style-name:普通表格;=20mso-style-parent:"";=20mso-style-noshow:yes;=20mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;=20mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;=20mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt;=20mso-para-margin:0pt;=20mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt;=20mso-pagination:widow-orphan;=20font-family:'Times New Roman';=20font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-ansi-language:#0400;=20mso-fareast-language:#0400;=20mso-bidi-language:#0400;=20}=20@page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no;=20	mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{=20margin-top:72.0000pt;=20margin-bottom:72.0000pt;=20margin-left:72.0000pt;=20margin-right:72.0000pt;=20size:612.0000pt 792.0000pt;=20mso-header-margin:36.0000pt;=20mso-footer-margin:36.0000pt;=20}=20div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style></head><body style=3D"tab-interval:21pt;" ><!--StartFragment--><div class=3D"Section0" ><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.5.3 如何设计数据模型</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据模型设计既然是整个数据仓库建设中一个非常重要的关键部分，那么就结合维度建模来谈谈怎么建设我们的数据仓库模型。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.核心业务流程梳理实例</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >这里我们将要以供应链业务为例子，介绍如何梳理业务流程，并适合自己的数据模型。下图是供应链核心的业务流程图。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"263"  src=3D"~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}135022.files/~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}135022285.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.首先</span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >识别业务过程</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。识别业务过程之前要</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >先找出业务中的实体</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。对于供应链体系来说主要的实体就是：供应商、商品、经销商、用户、仓库、资金等。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >把上边的业务流图稍作简化，大体业务流程如下：</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >经销商先向供应商采购。供应商发货给仓库入库。仓库理货，上架商品进行售卖。用户购买商品，然后仓库发货出库。物流快递派送商品到用户。用户确认收货。经销商和供应商进行财务结算。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2.整个流程走完，基本重要业务过程节点都清晰了。把这些关键节点的业务过程再进行细化和完善。比如采购之前，需要签合同，入库之前需要预约等。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3.业务过程梳理清晰后，还要根据实际的业务判断，哪些数据是获取不到的，哪些是业务部关注的。对业务过程进行精简，精简后就可以对核心的业务流程进行建模。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2.维度数据模型设计范例</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >从数据仓库的数据建模阶段的各个阶段的划分，我们能够了解到整个数据仓库建模的主要工作和工作量，从而能够对我们在实际的项目建设能够有所帮助。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >概念模型、逻辑模型、物理模型之间的关系如下图所示：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"339"  src=3D"~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}135022.files/~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}135022864.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >供应链的数据仓库的数据建模</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >大致分为三个阶段：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >概念建模</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，这部分的建模工作侧重业务分析，主要包含以下几个部分：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >理清业务活动并抽象化</font>;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >分析确认业务活动中参与业务实体</font>;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >分析确认业务实体之间的关系</font>;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"304"  src=3D"~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}135022.files/~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}1350221113.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >逻辑建模</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，这部分的建模工作侧重实体关系设计，主要包含以下几个部分：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >业务实体化的属性和值域</font>;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >梳理实体的属性和实体之间的联系</font>;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"409"  src=3D"~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}135022.files/~tmp{8ac5825a-b1db-48d3-8061-b2d74aacfda7}1350221327.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >物理建模</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >这部分的建模工作，主要是维度模型设计</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，主要包含以下几个部分：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >综合考虑存储和查询性能，选择</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >星型模型，雪花模型进行数据模型设计</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，主要包括维度表和事实表的设计</font>(不展开)， 其中实体通常以</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >DIM</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >（</font><font face=3D"宋体" >DIM =3D Dimension =3D 维度）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >维度表形式</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >构建。比如：供应商维表、商品维表等。业务过程以</font>DWD事实表形式构建。比如：采购单流水表、入库流水表、出库流水表等;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

